-- Tests of the Ofek Hadash agreements' root (l4/lib/ofek-hadash-root.l4): what it is asked, asserted. They sit
-- beside it and not in it (the client, 2026-10-22: "assertions about a file
-- should sit next to it, not be included in it"); the site shows them on
-- its page. `make l4` checks ofek-hadash-root through this file, which imports it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ofek-hadash-root`

§ `בדיקות שורש הסכמי אופק חדש`

-- What the site's page of this root lists (tools/roots.py): each
-- instrument it includes, its module and its name.
#EVAL map (GIVEN i YIELD CONCAT i's `module`, " | ", i's `title`) `the Ofek Hadash agreements' instruments`

-- It includes 2 instruments, each once.
#ASSERT count `the Ofek Hadash agreements' instruments` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT count (nub (map (GIVEN i YIELD i's `module`) `the Ofek Hadash agreements' instruments`)) EQUALS 2
